# AgentVault Project Conventions

- Always implement real, end-to-end behavior rather than stub or placeholder code.
- When creating new features, ensure that:
  - The upload → process → download flow remains functional.
  - Any new processing logic actually transforms data in a meaningful way.
- Keep individual source files roughly within 300–500 lines where possible; refactor if they grow larger.
- Add or update tests when changing behavior, and run them (or the app) to confirm there are no obvious errors.

